# Gabbaya patch series — applied in order on top of the InvoicePlane release
# named in UPSTREAM_VERSION (with `patch -p1` from the application root).
#
# One patch per line:  <file>  <status>
#   status = upstream:<PR-url>        submitted upstream; drop once released
#          | downstream-only:<reason> intentionally kept in Gabbaya only
#
# Every patch MUST have a status. When an upstream release contains the
# change, the patch fails to apply and the build breaks — that is the signal
# to remove it here.
#
